  <h2>Reacting to Changes</h2>
  <p>The stream emits the current value immediately on subscription, then re-emits each time the status changes. Use this to drive UI that reflects the current permission state without polling.</p>
  <CodeBlock code={reactingToChanges} title="ObservingChanges.swift" />

